<title>SWEDEN: Nordic airlines to announce cooperation plans.</title>
<headline>Nordic airlines to announce cooperation plans.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nordic airlines Braathens SAFE, Finnair and domestic Swedish airline Transwede Airways said on Wednesday they had scheduled a joint news conference about future cooperation.</p>
<p>&quot;Because of a new cooperation agreement between Norway's Braathens SAFE, Finland's Finnair and Sweden's Transwede Airways, we have the pleasure to invite you to the unveiling and signing of the agreement,&quot; they said in a statement.</p>
<p>The news conference is scheduled for April 3 at 1000 GMT, 1200 local, in Stockholm.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
